<title>UK: Pakistan sets $300 million three-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Pakistan sets $300 million three-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager ANZ Investment Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PAKISTAN</p>
<p> AMT     $300 MLN     BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY	.MAY.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +395 BP   PAY DATE    30.MAY.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY B2	  ISS PRICE  99.90     FULL FEES   0.75</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.90</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/PK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.375     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
